[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3124.549, "timestamp": "00:52:04", "text": "就像反应物就像是对"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3129.109, "timestamp": "00:52:09", "text": "视频做出反应，然后你给出你的……嗯……该怎么说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3131.581, "timestamp": "00:52:11", "text": "呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3132.87, "timestamp": "00:52:12", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3136.23, "timestamp": "00:52:16", "text": "呃，反应过度，表情太夸张了之"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3138.63, "timestamp": "00:52:18", "text": "类的。 不，哦，你只要表达"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3141.589, "timestamp": "00:52:21", "text": "你真实的感受就行了。 我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3150.95, "timestamp": "00:52:30", "text": "就像你在 YouTube 或任何地方可以制作的内容类型一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3157.67, "timestamp": "00:52:37", "text": "内容其实很简单，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3162.87, "timestamp": "00:52:42", "text": "你分享的所有想法和观点也都很重要，而"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3168.63, "timestamp": "00:52:48", "text": "我更倾向于做更多的音乐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3172.23, "timestamp": "00:52:52", "text": "直播。关键是，我目前的想法就像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3174.63, "timestamp": "00:52:54", "text": "意识形态。"}]